    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "I can see the Rathaus spire from here! Thank goodness, it looks like everyone's safe!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_345_folnic_1#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "Lisa, hurry!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "Okay!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk",
        "text": "Wh-what happened? Is there a fire?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk",
        "text": "My sons haven't come back. Has anyone seen them?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk",
        "text": "Where are the Gendarmerie?! Where is Severin?! Isn't he supposed to be a hero? And he's missing at a time like this?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "Everyone's panicking!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_345_folnic_1#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "But it looks like they haven't attacked the residential areas. Someone must be leading them!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_069#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "Everyone's been on edge for far too long. That explosion was all they needed to snap\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "Over here! We have to make sure the Rathaus is secure!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_069#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "Look! There's a lot of them! Hurry!"
    },
