    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected",
        "text": "Hah?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected",
        "text": "Not bad for a man your age. Must be nice to live without the constant torment of Oripathy, huh?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066#5",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Sure... If I gave up smoking in my younger days, you and your friends would be sharing a jail cell by now."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Get out of here. Out of respect for you as my fellow townsfolk, I won't\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_067"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected",
        "text": "Hah! Look at the mouth on this one! You think we don't know you're the last cop in Wolumonde?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066#5",
            "name2": "avg_npc_067",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "You..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066#5",
            "name2": "avg_npc_067",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected",
        "text": "Severin! The jig is up. Let us into the Rathaus so we can run our town already."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066#5",
            "name2": "avg_npc_067",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "What do you plan to do?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066#5",
            "name2": "avg_npc_067",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected",
        "text": "Hah?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066#5",
            "name2": "avg_npc_067",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Settle down. Truce. I'm going to smoke a cigarette while you tell me what exactly you want from this town. Go ahead."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Maybe Wolumonde can consider your demands."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066#5",
            "name2": "avg_npc_067",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected",
        "text": "What are you trying to pull?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066#5",
            "name2": "avg_npc_067",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Look, I'm putting down my sword. I think we can come to terms here. No need to fight."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066#5",
            "name2": "avg_npc_067",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected",
        "text": "Hah. Now you decide to be reasonable?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected",
        "text": "Hand over the murderer. And abandon your prejudices."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected",
        "text": "...I want to go home. And I want my job back. Simple enough?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066#5",
            "name2": "avg_npc_067",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "I just need you to fill out a report, and submit to regular physicals. Simple enough."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066#5",
            "name2": "avg_npc_067",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected",
        "text": "That's it?! You walled us in and left us to die!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected",
        "text": "All that's left of my block is a heap of earthquake rubble. It's all Originium clusters that could blow at any moment. You evacuated all the non-infected and we're running out of supplies. Is anyone coming to help us?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected",
        "text": "Oh right, I almost forgot. Because you suck at your job, Wolumonde is heading straight to hell, and we're just the first ones to be thrown under the bus."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected",
        "text": "You still think you're so bright, hiding the truth to 'maintain order?'"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066#5",
            "name2": "avg_npc_067"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "...*Sigh*."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Looks like my matches got wet. I guess I don't have a light. Let's get back to it."
    },
