        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "Let's make sure we're saving lives now."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "I'll have words for you soon, 'Schultz.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Sure. I'm all ears, Miss."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 1,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 0.5
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 2,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "Sir..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "I told you before, I'm not 'Sir.' I'm not your Schultz when we're alone. I'm Thor's father, and your uncle."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "No, Sir, you just... you were going to kill that Infected man."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "I won't deny it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "That's only going to make things worse! And you can't attack a member of the Wolumonde family so lightly!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Even if he told the militants that we're defenseless?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "You know what this means, Tatjana."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "You should have a heart, at least\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Can't always make the right choice, no matter how much you might want to. Not unless you're omniscient."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Objectively speaking, if a prophet or a banker baron told me just a few deaths would bring peace back to Wolumonde..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "I'd do it. No matter who had to die."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "...Even if..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "No. Matter. Who."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "...At least he managed to hold on to his life. That's good enough."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Let's get back to Rhodes Island. Did you tell them the truth? Did you already take them to the camp? That girl had a different look in her eye."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "You already knew...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "I was pretty sure. For what it's worth, I never saw the point in hiding it from them. But keeping it under wraps myself calmed a lot of people down."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "What's your read on them?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "I think they'll help Wolumonde. They're the same kind of people as Dr. Atro."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "*Cough* *cough*, *hack*. And you think they speak for all of Rhodes Island?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "They're the ones they sent. So I guess they should be decently representative?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Truth be told, if every Rhodes Island operator we ran into turned out to be a good person, that would disturb me a lot more."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "I'm thinking back... to a certain sniper. She was from Rhodes Island..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "The one who came with Dr. Atro and left shortly thereafter?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "I hope she didn't get swallowed up by the Catastrophe..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
