        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "Wh-what? Another attack?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066#5",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "At this point, every bandit for miles must know we have no Gendarmerie here."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "So what can we do? Get down on our knees and beg for mercy? Or fight to the bitter end?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
